B65 BASIC v0.1-dev (45GS02) for MEGA65
Derived from BBC BASIC (Z80) v5
(C) Copyright R.T.Russell 2025
MEGA65 (model $03), 384K chip RAM, 8MB attic RAM

>10 N%=0:M%=0
>20 EVERY 5,1 GOSUB 200
>30 AFTER 30 GOSUB 300
>40 T%=TIME:REPEAT UNTIL TIME-T%>=100
>50 DI:PRINT "ticks: ";N%;" after: ";M%;" left: ";TIMELEFT(1)
>60 PRINT ?&6E0, ?&6E2+256*?&6E3, ?&6E4
>70 ?&8000000=42:!&8000004=123456:PRINT ?&8000000, !&8000004
>80 X=PI:|&5F000=X:PRINT |&5F000
>90 END
>200 N%+=1:RETURN
>300 M%+=1:RETURN
>LIST 10,30
   10 N%=0:M%=0
   20 EVERY 5,1 GOSUB 200
   30 AFTER 30 GOSUB 300
>RUN
ticks: 10 after: 1 left: 5
         3       384         8
        42    123456
3.14159265
>
